{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id175796033"}, "name":{"label":"ptyblue"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-01-03T09:55:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1.7"}, "id":{"label":"2053762055"}, "title":{"label":"Brilliant at what it does but limited scope"}, "content":{"label":"Great app for maintaining streaks and for keeping up my motivation to get round to those tasks that are so easy to put off. Only gripes are that 12 items aren’t enough - another page or 8 to one page would be appreciated! An archiving feature would be great too", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id324631393"}, "name":{"label":"Sunjammer1667"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-12-28T07:22:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1.7"}, "id":{"label":"2035302085"}, "title":{"label":"One of the best habit-building apps out there"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve tried so many of them, but keep coming back to this one. Its simplicity and aesthetics alone are worth it (probably the only app of this type that offers a sufficient selection of icons.\n\nI do have a few suggestions, though. It would be really nice to have a journaling option, to be able to make notes to track the progress more easily. Also, the option to archive tasks once accomplished, instead of having to delete them. And only being able to do 12 at the time doesn’t seem enough. The icons are so hue, one panel could easily fit 8 instead of 6. Or having more panels. I would prefer keeping my negative tasks on a separate panel.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"4"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"7"}}, 
