{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id38329591"}, "name":{"label":"This Latest Review"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-11-07T15:36:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1.4"}, "id":{"label":"1904760032"}, "title":{"label":"Very good app, could be better."}, "content":{"label":"I’m glad I can export the data because I’ve not actively used the app for a while and I may want to use the data file in the future, but I’ve decided I’m deleting the app for now in favour of using an alternative that displays more detail in less space whilst maintaining a clean design.\n\nThe problem of water still not being measured in cups remains and has been on the developer’s to do list for a long time and is the only feature I need to be added.\n\nI don't drink an ounce of water or a litre, I drink a cup of water at a time, and 8 cups per day are recommended by doctors. Most drinks bottles are 500 millilitres, but this unit of measurement is also not available. I can set it to 0.5 litres, but there is no quantity (number of drinks) option.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id43405023"}, "name":{"label":"khrishan94"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-11-03T13:09:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1.4"}, "id":{"label":"1895133673"}, "title":{"label":"Less is More, I like!"}, "content":{"label":"It’s a simple app that allows you to track your activities. I like that there are only 6 items so you can focus on those most important ones.\n\nIn addition, you can set personalised reminders (for example I have different reminders for the weekend as opposed to midweek)\n\nStill don’t see the point of the negative streaks though... I barely notice they are there.\n\nFuture improvements : possible to make each activity a different colour?\n\nTop work guys keep it up :)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
