{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id362757664"}, "name":{"label":"Ginger prince 75"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-09-25T12:45:52-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1"}, "id":{"label":"1809651529"}, "title":{"label":"Basic for the price."}, "content":{"label":"This app is a very good idea however is overpriced for the basic role it performs. It is well set out and very easy to use. I know it's not meant to be the most entertaining app but it does feel a little basic for £4.99. I found that just having reminders on my phone popping up did exactly the same thing.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id292398636"}, "name":{"label":"Biderz5555"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-09-25T06:28:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1"}, "id":{"label":"1809152309"}, "title":{"label":"Great habit builder"}, "content":{"label":"I've used a few apps like this before and this is worth the money.\nMy advice is to start off with a few simple ones and associate it with a principle for stronger lasting effects\nFor instance I have a streak of \"fill out my bullet journal before playing games\" because I want to internalise my belief that I should do my work before gratifying myself. This approach makes it stick when that thought of doubt creeps in.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
