{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id36112810"}, "name":{"label":"pachyderm_fortress"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-09-10T01:20:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1783235463"}, "title":{"label":"Great app for tracking goals"}, "content":{"label":"This is a wonderfully designed app for tracking goals with lovely personalisation options and bright colours. \n\nIn the recent update the maximum number of streaks was increased from 6 to 12 making the app more versatile. \n\nThere are some times where the design gets in the way of the usability of the app by not adhering to iOS conventions - accessing the preferences and switching between pages could use more standard elements. \n\nI would welcome the ability to have individual tasks differently coloured e.g, red for health tasks, blue for work, etc. Presently one is limited to two tone monochrome on each task page.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
