{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id195486256"}, "name":{"label":"spezzers"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-08-10T15:54:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"1722116939"}, "title":{"label":"I like to Streak"}, "content":{"label":"Good motivating app and habit builder. \n\nNot so good if you want to make running a habit that automatically tracks. Link it to Apple Health, set a distance target and it can't diferentiate between running and walking (despite them being selectable options in Streaks). So, general walking contributes towards your running exercise target even if you don't want it to.\n\nAlso I keep finding myself trying to swipe between the two pages of goals, only to realize you can't and you need to tap a button... so maybe swipe navigation would be a nice addition.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
