{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id26285482"}, "name":{"label":"Wildhighlander"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-07-28T09:08:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0"}, "id":{"label":"1702216092"}, "title":{"label":"INTUITIVE BRILLIANCE"}, "content":{"label":"Rarely do people think through their app before designing and building it. But these guys really sat down and got to the core of the matter. If you want to create a change in your life then use this method. It is STREAKS ahead of the competition. It works. ...AND NOW AMAZINGLY WELL UPDATED.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id32541520"}, "name":{"label":"PMcMLXXIX"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-07-27T14:00:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0"}, "id":{"label":"1700985681"}, "title":{"label":"Interesting big update, almost there"}, "content":{"label":"This has been an app I use several times a day for over a year now and one I find really useful for motivating myself to do (or not do!) things.\n\nInteresting recent large update adds some features (like holidays from streaks) which I'd been hoping for. The app is a bit more complicated than it was, and its simplicity was one of the things I enjoyed about previous versions.\n\nOne thing I'd like added is a app-level setting to turn off the sounds, instead of having to switch them of one-by-one for each (of now 12-possible!) items.\n\nWorth reading the help section of the app to reveal a few extra details, such as shake-to-undo.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id133354518"}, "name":{"label":"ZipZapKapow"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-06-28T13:30:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.2"}, "id":{"label":"1661272687"}, "title":{"label":"Great Habit Builder!"}, "content":{"label":"Very clean and easy to use interface. Really easy to set up and get going and the Apple Watch integration is great. I love the step counter ability where it just adds it up for you. What I would quite like is the ability to keep track of how close I got to goal completion for the tasks it tracks using health stats. For example I keep getting close to my 10,000 steps a day goal but not quite making it. It would be helpful if this was displayed on the calendar just to see if I am improving. Regardless great app and is helping to build better habits.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
