{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id218938398"}, "name":{"label":"robbieshevlin"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-06-12T01:02:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.2"}, "id":{"label":"1641713018"}, "title":{"label":"Really good. But still room to be great"}, "content":{"label":"There is scope to be more flexible here. Being simplistic and focused on just 6 streak tasks has its limitations. \nThe sharing function is where it really lacks and could include some gamification, competitive side and accountability to peers all of which would significantly enhance the whole point of achieving streaks", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id215267188"}, "name":{"label":"Evlbzltyr"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-24T13:16:56-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.2"}, "id":{"label":"1623177900"}, "title":{"label":"Pretty good"}, "content":{"label":"It's a neat little app - great idea, simply presented, with a great look and feel - but at the same time, perhaps a little too simple? What you see is what you get, and what you see doesn't seem entirely worth the full price of the app.\n\nStill recommend it, if you have a couple of quid to spare.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id170042641"}, "name":{"label":"matthew85williams"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-04-29T23:41:13-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.2"}, "id":{"label":"1601241811"}, "title":{"label":"Good app but...."}, "content":{"label":"Needs a long term bar chart like pomodoro for those habits where you may miss a day but want to track how much time you've done. \n\nCould also do with a timer for your habit to track how much time you've spent on it each time and over a longer period.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id126387560"}, "name":{"label":"ProfessorDudley1"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-04-28T15:59:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.2"}, "id":{"label":"1600057259"}, "title":{"label":"Good, but could be better"}, "content":{"label":"Don't get me wrong, this is a good app for making good habits. It makes it easy to mark a habit as complete so that it isn't a chore to keep track of.\n\nIt isn't very good at tracking bad habits though. I would expect a better way of tracking when you have not done something, as if you were trying to break a bad habit. All you would need to do is reverse the colours for bad habits, so you mark off when you have done something you shouldn't have, by the end of the week you will be able to see how often you did the bad habit, and will be able to see how you progress over time. \n\nIt also doesn't make much sense to limit the number of tasks to 6. I know many people won't need to track more than that but what if they do? It seems kinda arbitrary to have a limit like this. I assume it is something to do with fitting all of the buttons in the today widget, but surely you could add as many as you like in the app and just mark up to 6 to be shown in the today widget?\n\nAnyway, those are my suggestions. It's a good app, but I can see where it could be improved.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
